cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the accompanying paper."
title: "hornet-report: citizen hornet sting, nest and sighting reporting with staff review and a public 1-km map"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Min
    given-names: Sung-Hyun
    affiliation: "Apiculture Division, National Institute of Agricultural Sciences, Rural Development Administration, Republic of Korea"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Karl7208/hornet-report-"
url: "https://karl7208.github.io/hornet-report-/"
keywords:
  - Vespa velutina
  - citizen science
  - hornet
  - honeybee
  - Supabase
abstract: >-
  Static web application (Korean/English) for reporting hornet stings, nests and sightings with
  photographs and location, a staff review workflow (approve/reject, species, nest removal records),
  a public map aggregated to about 1 km, aggregated fire-service nest-removal history, and an export
  of pilot-operation metrics. Back end: Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage).
